			title: "Read YUNG's Rebuilt Structures"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4F7A5E294B48D343"]
			description: [
				"Dungeons and Taverns, Repurposed Structures and smaller structure mods add places with different purposes. Read the building before treating every room as a combat corridor."
				"Some sites are excellent waystations, restoration projects or map landmarks. Check spawn safety and ownership before converting one into a base."
				"Take distinctive blocks sparingly when their absence would destroy the reason the structure looked interesting."
				"Dungeons and Taverns, Dungeons Plus, the Graveyard, Towns and Towers, and Repurposed Structures add destinations with different scales. Observe from outside and choose an objective before entering every doorway you see."
			]
