		{
			dependencies: ["4258CA348D075B32"]
			description: [
				"Identify line of sight, floor hazards and reinforcement paths before rushing a spawner. Place safe light and cover while leaving the team's retreat open."
				"Assume suspicious floors, tripwires and containers are deliberate until inspected. Shields and armour do not protect the blocks beneath your feet."
				"If preserving a spawner for a project, secure and label it immediately so another player does not enter an active room unknowingly."
				"Mark entrances, cleared routes, dangerous branches, and exits differently. Bring spare blocks and a water bucket, retreat to a secured room when inventory fills, and never let loot pressure erase the return path."
			]
			id: "256D9C584128753E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0409E0C43C4994EB"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			subtitle: "Control the room before collecting the reward"
