		{
			dependencies: ["5751FFD9F9146D57"]
			description: [
				"Record the structure name, coordinates, state, entrances, special hazards and unfinished objectives. Screenshots and map labels are useful; a short written summary is better."
				"Store keys, maps, trophies and unresolved clues together instead of losing them across personal backpacks."
				"An archive prevents the fifth player from becoming the fifth person to trigger the same trap."
				"Dungeons and Taverns, Dungeons Plus, the Graveyard, Towns and Towers, and Repurposed Structures add destinations with different scales. Observe from outside and choose an objective before entering every doorway you see."
				"Mark entrances, cleared routes, dangerous branches, and exits differently. Bring spare blocks and a water bucket, retreat to a secured room when inventory fills, and never let loot pressure erase the return path."
			]
