			title: "Restore, Reuse or Leave"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1FDF5F10CA01AE32"]
			description: [
				"Choose a new major structure, brief the group, prepare supplies, establish route markers and return with both loot and notes."
				"Invite another player to make at least one decision about route, risk or treasure. Leadership is coordination, not walking through every doorway first."
				"When the site is resolved, update the field archive and decide its future. That final decision completes the expedition."
				"The expedition doctrine is survey, secure, solve, salvage, and report. A dungeon is complete when the team understands it and can leave safely, not merely when the first chest has been emptied."
			]
			id: "2A40C01FFECFB190"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7FC8B5D7C67F13BF"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "A successful leader makes everyone useful"
			tasks: [{
