			title: "Dungeon School: Repurposed Structures"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3D63A9B7D6224D3A"]
			description: [
				"Dungeons and Taverns, Dungeons Plus, the Graveyard, Towns and Towers, and smaller structure mods range from safe flavour to extended combat. Observe size, sound, mobs, vertical reach, and number of entrances first."
				"Set an objective appropriate to scale: shelter at a tavern, survey a ruin, clear one dungeon level, or establish a camp outside a regional landmark. Not every visible doorway requires immediate completion."
				"If a structure is ugly, empty, or out of place, record coordinates and identify its mod before demolishing it. Diagnosis supports later configuration; frustration without attribution cannot improve the pack."
			]
			id: "7E71E1637E188F41"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0BF273838BF44AA0"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			subtitle: "Tavern, ruin, dungeon, or regional expedition"
			tasks: [{
